#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:3
msgid "损失函数设计"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:5
msgid "直觉：分类损失 vs 分割损失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:7
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"分类任务（{doc}`../cnn-expedition/practice-peak/cnn-"
"basics`）的交叉熵损失看的是\"每个像素分对了吗\"。但分割任务有一个特殊问题：**类别极度不平衡**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:9
msgid "想象一张 CT 图像，肿瘤只占 1% 的像素。如果模型把所有像素都预测为\"正常组织\"，准确率是 99%，但分割结果毫无意义——没找到肿瘤。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:11
msgid "分割损失的核心挑战是：**让模型关心\"少数派像素\"**，而不是只追求整体准确率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:13
msgid "交叉熵损失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:15
msgid "标准交叉熵"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:17
msgid ""
"L_{\\text{CE}} = -\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^N \\sum_{c=1}^C y_{i,c} "
"\\log(p_{i,c})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:21
#, python-brace-format
msgid "其中 $N$ 是像素数，$C$ 是类别数，$y_{i,c}$ 是真实标签，$p_{i,c}$ 是预测概率。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:23
msgid "加权交叉熵"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:25
msgid "缓解类别不平衡：给少数类更高的权重。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:27
msgid ""
"L_{\\text{WCE}} = -\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^N \\sum_{c=1}^C w_c \\cdot "
"y_{i,c} \\log(p_{i,c})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:31
msgid "权重 $w_c$ 通常与类别频率成反比。肿瘤只有 1% 像素，$w_{\\text{肿瘤}}$ = 99，$w_{\\text{正常}}$ = 1。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:33
msgid "焦点损失（Focal Loss）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:35
msgid ""
"L_{\\text{FL}} = -\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^N \\sum_{c=1}^C (1 - "
"p_{i,c})^\\gamma \\cdot y_{i,c} \\log(p_{i,c})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:39
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"$\\gamma$ 控制聚焦程度：$\\gamma=2$ "
"时，易分类样本的贡献被大幅降低，模型被迫关注难分类样本{cite}`lin2017focal`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:41
msgid "交叉熵的局限"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:43
msgid ""
"交叉熵优化的是**像素级准确率**，而我们真正关心的是**区域重叠度**。这两个目标在类别不平衡时可能南辕北辙——把所有像素都预测为\"背景\"，像素级准确率可能"
" >99%，但分割完全无效。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:45
#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:83
#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:154
msgid "Dice 损失"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:47
msgid "Dice 系数"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:49
msgid "Dice 系数直接衡量预测掩码与真实掩码的重叠程度："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:51
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\text{Dice} = \\frac{2|X \\cap Y|}{|X| + |Y|} = \\frac{2TP}{2TP + FP + "
"FN}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:55
msgid "Dice 系数 = 1 表示完美重叠，= 0 表示完全不重叠。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:58
msgid "Dice 系数的可视化"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:85
msgid "L_{\\text{Dice}} = 1 - \\text{Dice} = 1 - \\frac{2|X \\cap Y|}{|X| + |Y|}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:89
msgid "在二分类任务中的像素级实现："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:91
msgid ""
"L_{\\text{Dice}} = 1 - \\frac{2\\sum_{i=1}^N p_i y_i + "
"\\epsilon}{\\sum_{i=1}^N p_i + \\sum_{i=1}^N y_i + \\epsilon}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:95
msgid "Dice 损失的梯度分析"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:97
msgid "Dice 损失为什么对类别不平衡鲁棒？答案在它的梯度里。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:99
msgid "先定义软 Dice 损失（去掉 $\\epsilon$ 简化分析）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:101
#, python-brace-format
msgid "L = 1 - \\frac{2\\sum p_i y_i}{\\sum p_i + \\sum y_i}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:103
msgid "对第 $j$ 个像素的预测 $p_j$ 求导（链式法则，假设 $y_j=1$ 即该像素属于目标类）："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:105
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial p_j} = -2 \\cdot \\frac{y_j (\\sum p_i + "
"\\sum y_i) - (\\sum p_i y_i) \\cdot 1}{(\\sum p_i + \\sum y_i)^2}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:109
msgid "分子提出 $y_j=1$："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:111
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\\frac{\\partial L}{\\partial p_j} = -2 \\cdot \\frac{\\sum y_i - \\sum "
"p_i y_i}{(\\sum p_i + \\sum y_i)^2}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:115
msgid "分子 $\\sum y_i - \\sum p_i y_i$ = **真实面积 - 重叠面积** = 被漏检的区域大小。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:117
msgid "直觉：Dice 梯度在说什么？"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:120
msgid "Dice 的梯度大小正比于 **\"漏了多少\"**，反比于 **总面积的平方**。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:122
msgid "这意味着："
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:123
msgid "一个像素梯度的大小取决于**全局**漏检了多少，而不只是这个像素本身分对分错"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:124
msgid ""
"小目标（$\\sum y_i$ 很小）的梯度**天然放大**——因为分母 $(\\sum p_i + \\sum y_i)^2$ 中的 "
"$\\sum y_i$ 很小"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/unet-image-segmentation/loss-func.md:125
msgid "比交叉熵更均衡：交叉熵对每个像素给独立梯度，大目标有更多像素 → 梯度主导；Dice 把整张图作为一个整体来优化"
msgstr ""

